>>__ load "simpLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `safe_solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpLib.safe_solver_ss : Traverse.ssolver -> simpLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates an anonymous fragment containing one safe solver.
Installing it has the same effect as `add_safe_solver`.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide : Traverse.ssolver = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE};
>>_ val ss = simpLib.++
     (boolSimps.bool_ss,simpLib.safe_solver_ss decide);
>> simpLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe = true} ss [] ([], “x < x + 1”)
     (Context.snapshot());
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpLib.add_safe_solver),
[`simpLib.solver_ss`](#simpLib.solver_ss).
